<figure class="doc-cta not-prose relative my-5 overflow-hidden border border-gray-new-80 bg-[rgba(228,241,235,0.4)] px-7 py-6 sm:p-6 dark:border-gray-new-30 dark:bg-gray-new-10"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="188" height="195" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 h-full w-auto object-cover md:hidden" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/pattern.018v8u-wi2b.u.svg?dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/><div class="relative z-10"><h2 class="my-0! text-xl leading-tight font-medium tracking-tight text-black-pure dark:text-white">Request a new extension</h2><p class="mt-2.5 max-w-[490px] text-base leading-normal font-normal tracking-tight text-gray-new-20 opacity-90 dark:text-gray-new-85">Looking for a specific extension in Neon? Suggest one using this form.</p><form class="mt-6 flex items-end gap-4 md:flex-col md:items-start"><div class="flex-1 md:w-full"><div class="relative"><input class="h-11 w-full border border-gray-new-80 bg-white py-2 pr-8 pl-4 text-[15px] leading-snug tracking-extra-tight placeholder:text-gray-new-40 xl:text-sm focus:outline-none data-focus:outline-1 data-focus:-outline-offset-1 data-focus:outline-gray-new-70 dark:border-gray-new-30 dark:bg-gray-new-15 dark:placeholder:text-gray-new-60 dark:data-focus:outline-gray-new-30" autoComplete="off" placeholder="Select an extension" id="headlessui-combobox-input-_R_5mu7uj5fiv5uiknqdb_" role="combobox" type="text" aria-expanded="false" aria-autocomplete="list" data-headlessui-state=""/><button class="group absolute inset-y-0 right-0 px-2.5" id="headlessui-combobox-button-_R_9mu7uj5fiv5uiknqdb_" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" data-headlessui-state=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="15" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 15" class="size-4 stroke-black-new dark:stroke-white"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.5 5.75 7 9.25l3.5-3.5"></path></svg></button></div></div><input type="em