<p>The response body lists available libraries and whether the libraries are enabled by default. Response body attributes include:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>library_name</code>: library name, typically named for the associated extension</li>
<li><code>description</code>: a description of the extension</li>
<li><code>is_default</code>: whether the library is enabled by default</li>
<li><code>is_experimental</code>: whether the extensions is <a class="" href="#experimental-extensions">experimental</a></li>
<li><code>version</code>: the extension version</li>
</ul>
